Package: CausalBlocks
Type: Package
Title: Causal Discovery Between Blocks of Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Christian", "Thorjussen", email = "christianbern@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Causal discovery between blocks of data, where blocks are matrices
    measured on the same samples (different variables) or on the same variables
    (different samples, e.g. environments). Includes simulators with known
    ground truth, baseline discovery methods, and a computational conditional
    independence test based on sequential orthogonal PLS (SO-PLS) with rotation
    or permutation resampling, modelled on the CCI package.
License: GPL (>= 3)
